# Node: or.ByBuiltinRule.ClassicalImplication
# Rule struct: OrBuiltinClassicalImplication
# Run: litex -f examples/proof_nodes/or/by_builtin_rule/classical_implication.lit
#
# Packaging not A or B: assume A (= negate of the negative arm), prove B.
# Example: under a = 0, prove a * b = 0 ⇒ a != 0 or a * b = 0.

have a, b R
a != 0 or a * b = 0
